# CosmicPulse AI 🚀

## Intelligent Detection and Visualization of Radio Signals

CosmicPulse AI is an AI-powered platform for real-time radio signal detection, analysis, and visualization. It uses machine learning and digital signal processing to classify RF signals and detect anomalies through an interactive dashboard.

---

## Features ✨

- Real-time RF signal analysis
- AI-based signal classification
- Spectrum visualization
- FFT frequency analysis
- Noise reduction
- Anomaly detection
- Interactive dashboard

