## Installation ⚙️

### Clone Repository

git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/CosmicPulseAI.git

cd CosmicPulseAI

### Create Virtual Environment

python -m venv venv

### Activate Environment

Windows:

venv\Scripts\activate

Linux/Mac:

source venv/bin/activate

### Install Dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

---

## Run Project ▶️

python app.py

or

python run.py

